<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-MERITA STILL BUY AT LEHMAN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-MERITA STILL BUY AT LEHMAN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Thursday it reiterated its buy recommendation on Finland's leading banking group Merita Oy after it on Wednesday reported first half earnings above forecasts.</p>
<p>In its morning call note, it said a 30 markka price target &quot;looks conservative&quot; but gave no details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
